# API
API_HOST=127.0.0.1
API_PORT=8788
OPS_TOKEN=crave-local-ops
OPS_ALLOW_REMOTE=0
CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:4173,http://127.0.0.1:4173

# Web
WEB_PORT=4173

# Future production providers (unused in local demo)
# DATABASE_URL=
# SESSION_SECRET=
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
# TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=
# MAPS_API_KEY=

Local demo needs no cloud secrets. Operator board requires header x-ops-token (default crave-local-ops).
API binds 127.0.0.1 by default.
